/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.118 0.137 0.176 rg
42. 734.0900000000000318 Td
(   Valid\(j, r, s\) = NOT Holiday\(s.date\)  AND  Available\(j, s\)  AND  Available\(r, s\)  AND  NOT Booked\(j, s\)  AND  NOT Booked\(r, s\)  AND ) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.118 0.137 0.176 rg
42. 723.2899999999999636 Td
