/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.118 0.137 0.176 rg
42. 691.6899999999999409 Td
(   S = W_spec  *  SpecMatch\(j, cat\) + W_work  *  \(1 - Workload\(j\)/MaxCap\) + W_util  *  \(1 - RoomBookings\(r\)/MaxRoom\) + W_early  *  \(1) Tj
